{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shadows of Teotihuacan</strong> is a first-person mystery adventure set in the awe-inspiring ruins of an ancient civilization. As a private detective, you're hired by a desperate woman to locate her missing husband, last contacted while exploring the enigmatic pyramids of Teotihuacan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/bannernovi4.png?t=1741179180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CURRENT FEATURES :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Teotihuacan\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Navigate faithfully recreated ruins, including major structures of the ancient site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel a Mysterious Puzzle</strong> \u2013 Solve a story-driven challenge tied to your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong> \u2013 Experience the mystery up close through the eyes of a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive Through the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Take the wheel of a drivable vehicle to cover vast distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn the Ropes</strong> \u2013 A guided tutorial introduces basic movement and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542220/extras/bannernovi5.png?t=1741179180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLANNED FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improved character mechanics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Integration of the remaining puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passage of time mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_p